## Documentation & Structure

* Use clear doc comments for public members.
* Use consistent folder naming: `feature-name/feature.component.ts`.
* Maintain a `README.md` per feature if the module is large.
* Keep changelogs updated using the [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com) format.

---

## Linting & Quality

* Use ESLint with Angular-specific rules.
* Integrate Prettier for consistent code formatting.
* Enforce commit message standards with `commitlint`.
* Validate accessibility (ARIA attributes, focus management).

